<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-POUGET JOINS PARIS ST GERMAIN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POUGET JOINS PARIS ST GERMAIN.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French international  striker Cyrille Pouget on Saturday joined Paris St Germain for the rest of the season from Swiss club Servette.</p>
<p>PSG will have the option in six months time  to buy the 24-year-old who scored nine goals for Servette this season and was formerly with Metz in the French league.</p>
</text>
